[TITLE]
Precip scaling — COLD snow model with all three factors non-default.
Gage snow catch factor SCF = 0.7, subcatchment snow scale = 1.3, rain scale =
0.8. Air temperature pinned to 20 F (< SNOW_THRESHOLD 34 F) so all precip is
snow: the SCF (A1) and the snow scale factor (D3 accumulation/melt) are the
active levers; the rain scale rides along on token 9 to prove the writer/reader
hold both positions. Used by test_subcatch_scale_factors (snow-pack continuity)
and by the legacy-vs-C++ regression suite.

Snowfall injected into the pack each step (legacy gage.c:519, C++ splitPrecip):
    snowfall = gage_intensity * gage.SCF * subcatch.snowScale
             = 1.0 in/hr      * 0.7     * 1.3   = 0.910 in/hr equivalent
Both engines must agree, and the snow-pack runoff continuity must still close.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
INFILTRATION         HORTON
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2026
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             02:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30

[RAINGAGES]
;;Name Format Interval SCF Source
RG1  INTENSITY 1:00 0.7 TIMESERIES TS1

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
;;Name RainGage Outlet Area %Imperv Width Slope Curblen SnowPack RainScale SnowScale
S1  RG1  J1  10.0  100  500  0.5  0  SP1  0.8  1.3

[SUBAREAS]
;;Subcatch Nimp Nperv Simp Sperv PctZero RouteTo
S1  0.01  0.1  0.05  0.05  25  OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
;;Subcatch MaxRate MinRate Decay DryTime MaxInfil
S1  3.0  0.5  4.0  7  0

[TIMESERIES]
;;Name Date Time Value
TS1  01/01/2026 00:00 1.0
TS1  01/01/2026 01:00 1.0
TS1  01/01/2026 02:00 0.0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J1  100.0  10.0  0.0  0.0  0.0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name Elev Type
O1  95.0  FREE

[CONDUITS]
;;Name From To Length N InOff OutOff
C1  J1  O1  400.0  0.013  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link Shape Geom1 Geom2 Geom3 Geom4 Barrels
C1  CIRCULAR  1.5  0  0  0  1

[SNOWPACKS]
;;Name Surface Cmin Cmax Tbase FWF SD0 FW0 SNN0/SFrac
SP1  PLOWABLE    0.001  0.001  32  0.10  0  0  0.5
SP1  IMPERVIOUS  0.001  0.001  32  0.10  0  0  0.0
SP1  PERVIOUS    0.001  0.001  32  0.10  0  0  0.0
SP1  REMOVAL     1.0  0  0  0  0  0

